OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name woman, 92, killed
OL,4,Aafter being struck by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a woman who was
OL,7,Fkilled after being struck by a lorry in
OL,8,FInverness city centre.
OL,10,FMary Jane Goodwin, 92, died at the
OL,11,Fscene following the incident on Academy
OL,12,FStreet on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe area between Crown Road and Chapel
OL,15,FStreet was cordoned off for about seven
OL,16,Fhours while officers carried out an
OL,17,Finitial investigation.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland have issued an appeal
OL,20,Ffor information and asked anyone with
OL,21,Fdash cam footage to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
